51. WHY THE INTELLIGENCE SERVER EXISTS

Without the Intelligence Server, the Personal Intelligence Environment would need to directly coordinate:

- Models.
- Integrations.
- APIs.
- MCP.
- Devices.
- Workflows.
- Governance.
- Context.
- External services.

This creates architectural coupling.

The Intelligence Server provides the coordination boundary that keeps these components replaceable and independently evolvable.


